
# Project 03 — Humanoid Conversational AI

## Overview

Humanoid Conversational AI is an experimental AI system designed to explore more natural, context-aware and emotionally adaptive interactions between humans and language models.

Rather than treating an LLM as a simple question-answering engine, the project explores how multiple software components can work together to regulate conversation, preserve context and produce more coherent interactions over time.

> This case study intentionally presents only the high-level architecture.
> Internal prompts, behavioral rules, memory algorithms and proprietary orchestration mechanisms remain private.

